    "detailed_description": "<strong><u>What is &quot;Gift for You&quot;?</u></strong><br>This is a puzzle action game with 25 stages.<br>The goal of the game is to advance through the stages and reach the goal by manipulating the blocks with \u3010Move\u3011,\u3010Jump\u3011,\u3010Attack\u3011.<br><br><br><strong><u>Various gimmicks</u></strong><br>To clear a stage, you need to make full use of blocks with various effects.<br><br>(Example.)<br>Blocks that move when attacked<br>Blocks that make the player jump up when placed on them<br>Blocks that ascend and descend on a special floor<br>etc.<br><br><br><strong><u>Equipped with a ranking function</u></strong><br>The result screen when the game is cleared shows the time it took to clear the game.<br>If you beat your own best time, the record displayed on the title screen will be overwritten.<br><br>Beat your best time and aim for a higher ranking in the Steam ranking.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><u>What is &quot;Gift for You&quot;?</u></strong><br>This is a puzzle action game with 25 stages.<br>The goal of the game is to advance through the stages and reach the goal by manipulating the blocks with \u3010Move\u3011,\u3010Jump\u3011,\u3010Attack\u3011.<br><br><br><strong><u>Various gimmicks</u></strong><br>To clear a stage, you need to make full use of blocks with various effects.<br><br>(Example.)<br>Blocks that move when attacked<br>Blocks that make the player jump up when placed on them<br>Blocks that ascend and descend on a special floor<br>etc.<br><br><br><strong><u>Equipped with a ranking function</u></strong><br>The result screen when the game is cleared shows the time it took to clear the game.<br>If you beat your own best time, the record displayed on the title screen will be overwritten.<br><br>Beat your best time and aim for a higher ranking in the Steam ranking.",
    "short_description": "&quot;Gift for You&quot; is a puzzle action game consisting of 25 stages. Players must conquer a variety of puzzles and aim for the top ranking by clearing time.",
